export const STATEMENT_HTML = "<p><strong>Date:</strong> {{DATE}}</p>\n<p>This statement is from:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>You:</strong> {{SIGNER}} (\"you\")</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FoxLock is helping {{CLIENT}} document harassment by one person. {{CLIENT}} has asked whether you would write, in your own words, what you have seen and how it has affected her life. <strong>This is completely voluntary.</strong> Write only what you know yourself. There are no right or wrong answers, and nobody from FoxLock will tell you what to say.</p>\n<h2>1. About you</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>How you know {{CLIENT}}: <input type=\"text\" class=\"field\" name=\"relationship\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"e.g. close friend, coworker, brother\"></li>\n<li>How long you have known her: <input type=\"text\" class=\"field\" name=\"known_for\" maxlength=\"60\" placeholder=\"e.g. 6 years\"></li>\n<li>A phone number or email where {{CLIENT}}'s attorney can reach you, if needed: <input type=\"text\" class=\"field\" name=\"contact\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"Phone or email\" autocomplete=\"email\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2. Your statement</h2>\n<p>Some things you might write about. Use any of them, all of them or none:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What you have seen or heard yourself, and roughly when. Approximate dates help.</li>\n<li>Any messages you received from him, or about {{CLIENT}}.</li>\n<li>Changes you have noticed in {{CLIENT}}: her mood, sleep, sense of safety, work or school, friendships, daily life.</li>\n<li>How it has affected you or other people around her.</li>\n</ul>\n<textarea name=\"statement\" maxlength=\"20000\" rows=\"14\" placeholder=\"Write your statement here, in your own words.\"></textarea>\n<h2>3. How your statement is used</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>It is saved exactly as you wrote it, with a digital fingerprint (SHA-256) so anyone can later confirm it was not changed. FoxLock does not edit, shorten or correct it.</li>\n<li>It goes to {{CLIENT}} and her attorney. It may be filed with a court (for example with a protective order petition) or given to police.</li>\n<li><strong>How your name appears in {{CLIENT}}'s records</strong> (choose one):</li>\n<li class=\"choice\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"name_in_record\" value=\"name\"> <span>My full name.</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"choice\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"name_in_record\" value=\"initials\"> <span>My initials only.</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"choice\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"name_in_record\" value=\"label\"> <span>A label (e.g. \"Witness A\").</span></label></li>\n<li>Whichever you choose, your full name stays on the signed statement itself, because a statement used in court must be signed by name.</li>\n<li>The attorney, police or a court may ask you to confirm your statement. Whether you take part is up to you.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>4. Privacy and safety</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>We will not contact the person harassing {{CLIENT}}, or tell him you wrote this.</li>\n<li>Your statement is kept in encrypted storage that only the people working on this case can access, for <strong>90 days</strong> after the case report is delivered, unless it is needed longer for a court or police case, and then deleted.</li>\n<li>Don't reply to or forward his messages, and don't delete them.</li>\n<li>If you ever feel unsafe, call 911. FoxLock is not law enforcement and not a law firm, and this form is not legal advice.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>5. Withdrawal</h2>\n<p>You can withdraw your statement at any time by text or in writing. We will stop using it and take it out of {{CLIENT}}'s records. Anything already filed with a court or given to police before you withdrew stays with them, but we will tell you exactly what was shared.</p>\n<h2>6. Declaration</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"choice\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"declaration\" value=\"yes\"> <span>I hereby declare that the above statement is true to the best of my knowledge and belief, and that I understand it is made for use as evidence in court and is subject to penalty for perjury.</span></label></li>\n</ul>";
